  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: SocialRecluse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'player continues to drive home to jessi how socially inept she truly
    is. pointing out all her failures in basic conversation, she has no idea why
    jessi even tries so hard when she clearly can''t do it; it''s obviously wasted
    effort that just takes up time more valuable than hers.


    jessi seems like
    she''s about to cry out of frustration, but she holds it in. through gritted
    teeth, she expresses that she doesn''t care; she just has to keep trying. she
    has to. she needs to.


    she NEEDS to? what kind of obligation does she have
    to be a social butterfly? who is demanding this from her other than herself?
    certainly not anyone else, for that matter. the player wonders why jessi''s life
    is so driven by this need to interact with other people, and wants to pry further.
    she gets to decide how she wants to go about it.'
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: placeholder line
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Force it out of her
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Be subtle about it
